  "description": "Place n queens on an n x n chessboard such that no two queens attack each other.",
  "target": 4,
  "pseudocode": "1. solve(row, board) { \n2. if (row == n) add board to results; \n3. for (col = 0; col < n; col++) { \n4. if (isSafe(row, col)) { \n5. board[row][col] = 1; \n6. solve(row + 1, board); \n7. board[row][col] = 0; \n8. } } }",
